    10  /* this code supports:
    11   * reading:
    12   *     everything, except images with 1 dimension or images with
    13   *     mapmode != NORMAL (e.g. dithered); Images with 16 bit
    14   *     precision or more than 4 layers are stripped down.
    15   * writing:
    16   *     Run Length Encoded (RLE) or Verbatim (uncompressed)
    17   *     (whichever is smaller)
    18   *
    19   * Please report if you come across rgb/rgba/sgi/bw files that aren't
    20   * recognized. Also report applications that can't deal with images
    21   * saved by this filter.
    22   */
